    {
      "id": "claim_9e2c5ffb41f44745b38bbded80f7319f",
      "statement": "SegmentKind (an 11-variant enum, serde kebab-case) encodes both which segments are enabled (presence in Config.segments) and their render order; SegmentKind::ALL is the canonical 11-segment order and SegmentKind::DEFAULT is the 8-segment default that mirrors the bash statusline's order (Lines placed between Context and RateLimits).",
