      "statement": "The composer (render_fixed and the no-wrap path of render_auto) builds a fresh SegmentWriter per enabled segment, and appends a separator only between two adjacent non-empty segments; an empty/absent segment therefore takes its separator with it, and the auto path drops empty segments before wrapping.",
